  "content": "<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h5><h5><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e9Rfy4a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"719\"></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>《餘生》是一款融合殭屍與SCP元素的末日模組包。</strong></span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">《餘生》設定在充滿槍械與科技的現代時代，但同時充斥著極度危險的SCP生物以及成群的殭屍。<br></span></em></strong><strong><em><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">你有辦法在殭屍大軍與SCP收容失效事件中存活下來嗎？！</span></em></strong></h5><p><em style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"235\" height=\"32\"></a></span></strong></em></p><h5 style=\"text-align:left\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4cVq7KSTvJo\" width=\"418\" height=\"235\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/n2TX6ziweNM\" width=\"418\" height=\"235\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_Lh2sJNk7i4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"418\" height=\"244\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a7I3avI0IiU\" width=\"418\" height=\"234\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></h5>",
